1 NOTE There is a monument to him and his family in the Church of St. Mary the V
2 CONC irgin in the village of Chard, Somerset, England.The mural is the coupl
2 CONC e facing each other and behind them knelling in pairs are the children, t
2 CONC he boys behind their father and the girls behind their mother. The insc
2 CONC ription says "Here lieth intered (expecting their Savior) the bodyes of W
2 CONC ill Brewer of Chard, Phistian, & Deanes, his wife, who lived 40 years i
2 CONC n happie wedlock, in full age departing this life shee dying 8th Novemb
2 CONC er 1614 and hee 24th July 1618 havying issue only six sons and five dau
2 CONC ghters all men and women grown & allcomfors to them"[FTW.POWELL.FBK.FTW
2 CONC ]
2 CONT
2 CONT There is a monument to him and his family in the Church of St. Mary the V
2 CONC irgin in the village of Chard, Somerset, England.The mural is the coupl
2 CONC e facing each other and behind them knelling in pairs are the children, t
2 CONC he boys behind their father and the girls behind their mother. The insc
2 CONC ription says "Here lieth intered (expecting their Savior) the bodyes of W
2 CONC ill Brewer of Chard, Phistian, & Deanes, his wife, who lived 40 years i
2 CONC n happie wedlock, in full age departing this life shee dying 8th Novemb
2 CONC er 1614 and hee 24th July 1618 havying issue only six sons and five dau
2 CONC ghters all men and women grown & allcomfors to them"
